# Battle Arena API Standards

- Keep this repository independent. Do not convert to a monorepo.
- Prefer incremental fixes over rewrites. Preserve working catalog endpoints.
- Never hardcode secrets. Use `.env.example` for documented keys only.
- Do not claim tests passed without running them.
- User-facing strings go through Laravel `__()` / lang files for `en`, `fr`, `pt_BR`, `it`, `es`.
- Stable JSON field names stay English (`base_stats.attack`, `image_url`).
- Do not use destructive DB commands (`migrate:fresh`, volume deletes) unless explicitly requested.
